OL,3,ARow over George Michael items up for
OL,4,Aauction - including Faith guitar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family row has broken out over an
OL,7,Fauction of George Michael memorabilia
OL,8,Ftaking place on Thursday.
OL,10,FThe guitar the singer-songwriter
OL,11,Fperformed with in the Faith music video
OL,12,Fis one of several items being auctioned
OL,13,Fby Sworders from the collection of
OL,14,FSiobhan Bailey, Michael's long-time
OL,15,Fpersonal assistant.
OL,17,FSiobhan died in 2014 and the items are
OL,18,Fbeing sold by her estranged husband Ian
OL,19,FBelcher, who inherited them after her
OL,20,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
